            "text": "{\"events\":[{\"id\":\"6a0f5ec95f8fd8b5246aa45e\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"CUBA: Technological Disobedience : Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>This screening is made in collaboration with North London Cuba Solidarity Campaign</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Representative of the Cuban Embassy will attend and answer questions.</strong></p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Cuba: Technological Disobedience</strong></h1><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">From Aljazeera (2026)</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\">In US-blockaded Cuba, ingenious mechanics and inventors revive old machines in order to survive during a time of scarcity.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\">When the Soviet Union collapsed in 1991, Cuba was plunged into crisis. Fuel, food and spare parts vanished almost overnight. This character-led documentary shows how common Cubans refused to give up – and instead built a new culture of radical repair. From Havana’s Malecon to small-town back yards, it follows mechanics, street vendors and a teacher-turned-inventor who live by one rule: “invent and resolve”.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\">A pristine US Plymouth Fury convertible of the 1950s hides a Soviet engine, Japanese gearbox and handmade parts; washing machines become coconut graters, solar dryers and tools for urban farms. Cuban historians and designer Ernesto Oroza reveal the philosophy behind this “technical disobedience”, treating every object as raw material to hack and extend. Far from nostalgia, the film offers a stark snapshot of a future in which resources are scarce and the power to repair may be our most important tool.</p><h2 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></h2>\",\"short_description\":\"The Spanish Civil War seen from outside\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-06-16T18:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-07-17T19:30:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a0f5ec95f8fd8b5246aa45f\",\"name\":\"Watch online, Please make a donation to help us cover costs.\",\"price\":100,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":68,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"max_quantity_per_person\":null,\"variable_price\":true,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a0f5ec95f8fd8b5246aa465\",\"type\":\"livestream\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"CUBA: Technological Disobedience : Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"sort_key\":\"CUBA: Technological Disobedience : Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"short_description\":\"The Spanish Civil War seen from outside\",\"unballoted\":true,\"details\":{},\"credits\":{},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"virtual_content\":{\"id\":\"6a0f5ec95f8fd8b5246aa467\",\"type\":\"livestream\",\"status\":\"livestream_not_created\",\"export_status\":\"export_not_requested\",\"livestream_ingest_urls\":[],\"livestream_preview_first\":true,\"livestream_transcription_enabled\":false,\"livestream_premium_enabled\":false,\"live_chat_visible\":true,\"live_chat_participation_enabled\":true,\"live_chat_show_viewer_count\":true,\"ams_drm_enabled\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-21T19:36:41.574Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-21T19:36:41.574Z\",\"platform\":\"eventive\",\"caption_tracks\":[]},\"start_time\":\"2026-06-16T19:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-06-16T21:55:00.000Z\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-21T19:36:41.561Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-21T19:36:41.561Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true,\"livestream_mode\":\"embedded\",\"livestream_embed_code\":\"<div itemscope itemtype=\\\"https://schema.org/VideoObject\\\" style=\\\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"name\\\" content=\\\"Sands Films Virtual Cinema Club (64)\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"This is the live stream from Sands Films Cinema Club\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"uploadDate\\\" content=\\\"2026-06-16T20:43:40.000Z\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"thumbnailUrl\\\" content=\\\"https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/bgVtA1gCRaUK_vd8Q/x120\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"duration\\\" content=\\\"P6381S\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"embedUrl\\\" content=\\\"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player/x15jgk.html?video=k6xkoNjUA9qtBkGLnpU\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"contentUrl\\\" content=\\\"https://www.dailymotion.com/crawler/video/xag7r9m\\\"><iframe frameborder=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;overflow:hidden;\\\" src=\\\"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player/x15jgk.html?video=k6xkoNjUA9qtBkGLnpU&playlist=x7ilc3\\\" allowfullscreen allow=\\\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" title=\\\"Dailymotion video player – Sands Films Virtual Cinema Club (64)\\\"></iframe></div>\"}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:00:37.456Z\",\"is_virtual\":true,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":true,\"allow_preorder\":true,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_closed\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"virtual_balloting_consolidated\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":false,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":false,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":false,\"virtual_show_donate_prompt\":true,\"virtual_donate_message\":\"Support Sands Films Cinema Club and help cover our costs with an optional donation.\",\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[{\"url\":null,\"image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1fe438b7871e29ed9cca4e3cbab6b325.png\"}],\"images\":{\"still\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1779392341471temp-1779392341429-default.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p><strong>Thank you for booking this online presentation.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The link will be live some 15 minutes before the advertised time; it will remain active for 7 days for you to complete watching.</strong></p><p><strong>The Cinema Club has an alternative back up stream here: </strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Please feel free to send feedbacks, comments or complaints:</u> filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk</strong></p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6a0f583c40fdb6dd164f6f39\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"Land & Freedom: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">LAND &amp; FREEDOM</h1><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Ken Loach, 1995</p><p>Scripted by his regular collaborator, Jim Allen, Loach's movie is a visceral, emotional and intellectual experience, and among the finest films of the decade. It begins in 1994 with the death of Dave Carne, an octogenarian working-class Liverpudlian, living alone in a tower block, its hallways daubed with National Front and anti-NF graffiti. His granddaughter, Kim, a woman in her twenties, opens a case of his mementoes 'press-cuttings, photographs, letters' that take her back through labour history to the Spanish Civil War. Among the souvenirs is a handful of Spanish earth wrapped in a red neckerchief.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><em>Dennis Grunes' book published by Sands Films Cinema Club which you can&nbsp;</em><a href=\\\"https://ebay.us/m/k84hLz\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 242);\\\"><em>purchase here&nbsp;</em></a><em>if you haven’t already done so.</em></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/b4747d9cff5ee95ffeddb1a030785800.png\\\"></p><p>2026 marks the 90th anniversary of the start of the Spanish Civil War; Sands Films Cinema Club presents three series of films about this tragedy. The first series will look at the war as seen from outside, by non-Spanish filmmakers. The second selection of films will introduce films about the war made in Spain under Franco. The final series will look a the representation of the war by Spanish filmmakers, after Franco.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/films/6a0622ae4d08c32d36c4f737\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 242);\\\"><img src=\\\"https://static-a.eventive.org/0eafbc39e492686892a1ae6db33ee196.jpg?w=300\\\" style=\\\"border-radius: 0.1rem; display: block; height: auto; max-width: 100%; width: 170px;\\\"></a></p><p>David Carr is a British Communist who is unemployed. In 1936, when the Spanish Civil War begins, he decides to fight for the Republican side, a coalition of liberals, communists and anarchists, so he joins the POUM militia and witnesses firsthand the betrayal of the Spanish revolution by Stalin's followers and Moscow's orders.</p><p><br></p><ul><li><em>Year:</em></li><li>1995</li><li><em>Runtime:</em></li><li>109&nbsp;minutes</li><li><em>Language:</em></li><li>Catalan, English, Spanish</li><li><em>Director:</em></li><li>Ken Loach</li><li><em>Screenwriter:</em></li><li>Jim Allen</li><li><em>Producer:</em></li><li>Rebecca O'Brien</li><li><em>Executive Producer:</em></li><li>Ulrich Felsberg, Gerardo Herrero, Sally Hibbin</li><li><em>Cast:</em></li><li>Ian Hart, Rosana Pastor, Frédéric Pierrot</li><li><em>Cinematographer:</em></li><li>Barry Ackroyd</li><li><em>Editor:</em></li><li>Jonathan Morris</li><li><em>Production Design:</em></li><li>Martin Johnson</li><li><em>Composer:</em></li><li>George Fenton</li></ul><h2 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></h2>\",\"short_description\":\"The Spanish Civil War seen from outside\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-06-23T18:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-07-24T19:30:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a00e1c17e9ee528f15d8298\",\"name\":\"The Spanish Civil War\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"trai