th anniversary of the start of the Spanish Civil War; Sands Films Cinema Club presents three series of films about this tragedy. The first series will look at the war as seen from outside, by non-Spanish filmmakers. The second selection of films will introduce films about the war made in Spain under Franco. The final series will look a the representation of the war by Spanish filmmakers, after Franco.</p><p><br></p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1778442078735temp-1778442078687-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1778442069913temp-1778442069884-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{},\"credits\":{},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-10T19:35:04.673Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-20T20:10:47.630Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a06234225632753824bc4bf\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"Songs for After a War\",\"sort_key\":\"Songs for After a War\",\"description\":\"A particular reading of the hard years of famine, repression and censorship after the massacre of the Spanish Civil War (1936-39), through popular culture: songs, newspapers and magazines, movies and newsreels.\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/f41979f7099cf2345fad6969f6859fa1.jpg?fit=crop&w=960&h=380\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/ca8ccd5eba7c0175b5b0d4dbd973fc0f.jpg?w=300\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/770f8b4e3f9d0054fa820fc7be6f0e5b.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"1976\",\"language\":\"Spanish\",\"runtime\":\"101\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Basilio Martín Patino\",\"animator\":null,\"cast\":\"Francisco Franco, Philippe Pétain, Imperio Argentina\",\"cinematographer\":\"José Luis Alcaine\",\"co_producer\":null,\"composer\":\"Manuel Parada\",\"editor\":null,\"executive_producer\":null,\"filmmaker\":null,\"music\":null,\"producer\":null,\"production_design\":null,\"screenwriter\":\"José Luis García Sánchez, Basilio Martín Patino\",\"sound_design\":null},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a00e1c17e9ee528f15d8298\",\"name\":\"The Spanish Civil War\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true}],\"imdb_id\":\"tt0066901\",\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-14T19:32:18.647Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-14T19:54:56.389Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-30T09:13:03.038Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1782225089655temp-1782225089599-cover.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1782225089922temp-1782225089878-avatar.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for reserving a seat at Sands Films Cinema Club.</p><p><br></p><p>Should you decide to cancel your attendance please email <a href=\\\"mailto:filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk</a></p><p>We will send you an online access instead so you can watch the film live or later at a convenient time and will make your seat available to someone else.</p><p>Thank you for your support and your donation.</p><p><br></p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6a42a2cb6e7be8ee11b6494e\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"The Man With The Plan\",\"description\":\"<p><br></p>\",\"short_description\":\"The Man With The Plan\",\"location\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"616324bd6f5b7b00459ce70e\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"Sands Cinema\",\"description\":\"Film preview theatre\",\"address\":\"82 St Marychurch Street\\nLondon, SE16 4HZ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#23a833\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":true},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-07-20T18:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-07-20T20:30:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"62123230d91dcb00cdf88dd4\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Own Production\",\"color\":\"#068a32\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":91,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a42a2cb6e7be8ee11b6494f\",\"name\":\"General Admission: pay what you can \",\"price\":1200,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":60,\"quantity_sold\":6,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":54,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":true,\"variable_price_minimum\":1000,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6984ee5b0a5c263491bcdb6b\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"The Man With The Plan\",\"sort_key\":\"Man With The Plan, The\",\"short_description\":\"A young person's investigation into the Beveridge Report and what happened to it.\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>A young student, Flea (Sophie Jenkin), discovers the 1942 Beveridge report – and its comprehensive vision for a better society. Flea’s fantastical journey takes her amongst Beveridge’s Five Giants: Want, Disease, Squalor, Idleness &amp; Ignorance and the whirl of politicians, ineffective policies and missed opportunities across the decades until now.</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Based on texts and speeches by Beveridge and politicians, the film is a moving account of Beveridge’s vision, the desperate need for it today and a passionate call for action.</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>\\\"an urgent film for our desperate times…a full-blown exposition on why if we had done what Beveridge advocated we might be in a better place today.\\\"</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.bigissue.com/opinion/the-man-with-the-plan-film/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Read John Bird's review in THE BIG ISSUE</a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Starring Simon Callow as William Beveridge,&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>with Sophie Jenkin, Mark Thomas, Alan Cox, Neil Gore, Neil D'Souza,</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Andrew Tiernan, Hal Cruttenden, Michael Mears, many others</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>and the voice of Miriam Margolyes.&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Also, with the appearance of Sir Michael Marmot, Kate Pickett, Danny Dorling and</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>many other academics, campaigners and activists.</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Written and directed by Christine Edzard</strong></p><p><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1770319670669temp-1770319670579-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1770319612900temp-1770319612838-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1770319658173temp-1770319657988-still.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://youtu.be/KdfG0yKyx0o?si=a1blFRr0n-Syplr2\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"country\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":\"Educational Docu-drama\",\"language\":\"English\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"runtime\":\"105\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\",\"year\":\"2026\"},\"credits\":{\"cast\":\"Simon Callow, Sophie Jenkin, Neil Gore, Alan Cox\",\"cinematographer\":\"Joachim Bergamin\",\"director\":\"Christine Edzard\",\"editor\":\"Olivier Stockman\",\"music\":\"Michel Sanvoisin\",\"producer\":\"Olivier Stockman\",\"sound_design\":\"Robert Carr\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"62123230d91dcb00cdf88dd4\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Own Production\",\"color\":\"#068a32\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6212329f6ee92e007e8874e6\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#7296ee\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"62864f08d1b7850037fc9b81\",\"name\":\"Fiction & drama (English Language)\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-05T19:24:11.076Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-14T16:26:54.598Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-29T16:52:49.690Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":