 Admission: pay what you can \",\"price\":1200,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":60,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":60,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":true,\"variable_price_minimum\":1000,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6984ee5b0a5c263491bcdb6b\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"The Man With The Plan\",\"sort_key\":\"Man With The Plan, The\",\"short_description\":\"A young person's investigation into the Beveridge Report and what happened to it.\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>A young student, Flea (Sophie Jenkin), discovers the 1942 Beveridge report – and its comprehensive vision for a better society. Flea’s fantastical journey takes her amongst Beveridge’s Five Giants: Want, Disease, Squalor, Idleness &amp; Ignorance and the whirl of politicians, ineffective policies and missed opportunities across the decades until now.</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Based on texts and speeches by Beveridge and politicians, the film is a moving account of Beveridge’s vision, the desperate need for it today and a passionate call for action.</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>\\\"an urgent film for our desperate times…a full-blown exposition on why if we had done what Beveridge advocated we might be in a better place today.\\\"</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.bigissue.com/opinion/the-man-with-the-plan-film/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Read John Bird's review in THE BIG ISSUE</a></